✅ SAFE VERSION (LESS ERROR-PRONE)

Instead of:

'Section In-charge'.Value = Dropdown_Section.Selected.Title

👉 Use this:

'Section In-charge'.Id = Dropdown_Section.Selected.ID

✔ More reliable
✔ Avoids text mismatch issues


